# LisGenie Chatbot Program (iP)
> "The way to get started is to quit talking and begin doing". - [Walt Disney](https://www.forbes.com/sites/lewishowes/2012/07/17/20-business-quotes-and-lessons-from-walt-disney/?sh=39926494ba9a)
## A Fun CLI-Style App
**LisGenie Chatbot** frees your mind of having to remember things you need to do. It's,
* text-based
* easy to learn
* ~~FAST~~ *SUPER* FAST to use

All you need to do is,

1. clone its repo from [here](https://github.com/gweeyc/ip.git).
1. open the project in your favorite Java IDE app.
1. run the program.
1. add your tasks using CLI commands, e.g.
   1. todo `<task description>`
   1. deadline `<task description>< /by ><datetime>`
   1. event `<task description>< /at ><datetime>`
1. let it manage your tasks for you 😀 

And it is **FREE**!

Features:

- [x] Managing tasks
- [ ] Managing deadlines
- [ ] Reminders (coming soon)
* * *
